@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Public health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json
Accept: application/json

### Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs
Accept: text/html

### Uniform 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/unknown
Accept: application/json

### Unsupported method (405; Allow: GET)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/health

### Unacceptable representation (406)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: text/html

### Unsupported write Content-Type (415)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/unimplemented
Content-Type: text/plain

example

### Malformed JSON (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/unimplemented
Content-Type: application/json

{"invalid":
